import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 271 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantifying the Benefits of Institutional Alternative: Civilization Trajectory After Injecting Anchor Symbiosis","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 271 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantifying the Benefits of Institutional Alternative: Civilization Trajectory After Injecting Anchor Symbiosis","no":271,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Institutional Alternative","Benefits Quantified","Anchor Symbiosis","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["74-300-System Opening Event","75-20% Activation Strategy Implementation","77-Myriad Races Republicanism Established"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0271_模块2-唐罗-制度替代收益量化.md","filePath":"en/0271_模块2-唐罗-制度替代收益量化.md"}'),a={name:"en/0271_模块2-唐罗-制度替代收益量化.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-271-tang-luo-decomposition-quantifying-the-benefits-of-institutional-alternative-civilization-trajectory-after-injecting-anchor-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">Entry 271 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantifying the Benefits of Institutional Alternative: Civilization Trajectory After Injecting Anchor Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-271-tang-luo-decomposition-quantifying-the-benefits-of-institutional-alternative-civilization-trajectory-after-injecting-anchor-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 271 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantifying the Benefits of Institutional Alternative: Civilization Trajectory After Injecting Anchor Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 21)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-inject-anchor-symbiosis-what-will-tang-luo-s-world-become" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Inject Anchor Symbiosis, what will Tang-Luo&#39;s world become <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-inject-anchor-symbiosis-what-will-tang-luo-s-world-become" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Inject Anchor Symbiosis, what will Tang-Luo&#39;s world become&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the collective ascension axiom requires strong ones to lift Myriad Races forward together. This entry reverse-deduces in the Quest Sediment Domain: if Anchor Symbiosis institutions (300 systems open + Alaya supervision + Myriad Races republicanism) are injected into the Tang-Luo world, where will civilization go? This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, quantifying institutional alternative benefits. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-post-alternative-perspective" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Post-Alternative Perspective) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-post-alternative-perspective" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Post-Alternative Perspective)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After injecting Anchor Symbiosis, Tang Luo&#39;s original energy-level wastes are eliminated one by one:</p><ul><li>Racial dimension: Myriad Races included, talent pool expands tenfold</li><li>Tier dimension: Origin Realm fully open, top-tier knowledge goes from private hoarding to whole-network sharing</li><li>Institutional dimension: four powers separated, single point becomes network</li><li>Time dimension: good policies written into constitution, legacy-favor decay eliminated</li><li>Network dimension: Alaya distributed, single-point failure eliminated</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-post-alternative-comparison" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Post-Alternative Comparison) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-post-alternative-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Post-Alternative Comparison)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Post-alternative civilization trajectory is no longer &quot;hundred-year regression,&quot; but &quot;hundred-year ascension&quot;:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Tang-Luo Original After a Hundred Years</th><th>After Injecting Anchor Symbiosis a Hundred Years</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SPDCI</td><td>0.82</td><td>0.05</td></tr><tr><td>Cultivation population</td><td>Slow growth then stagnation</td><td>Tenfold growth</td></tr><tr><td>Number breaking through Origin Realm</td><td>0</td><td>Batch output</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Races participation</td><td>&lt;5%</td><td>&gt;95%</td></tr><tr><td>Demonic-deviation rate</td><td>Rising</td><td>Drops 90%</td></tr><tr><td>Old-force restoration count</td><td>Multiple</td><td>Approaches zero</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Institutional alternative&#39;s essence is inviting Tang Luo down from the &quot;predator position&quot;:</p><ul><li>He no longer needs to &quot;bestow,&quot; because institutions have confirmed rights</li><li>He no longer needs to &quot;guard the gate,&quot; because the ladder is infinite</li><li>He no longer needs to &quot;dictate,&quot; because four powers are separated</li><li>He can still contribute, but contribution is &quot;official duty,&quot; not &quot;sage lord&#39;s grace&quot;</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>; after institutional alternative, the &quot;predator&quot; label is automatically lifted — not that Tang Luo changed, but the predation structure is dismantled.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alternative&#39;s complete benefit chain:</p><ol><li>300 Origin systems open → top-tier knowledge whole-network shared</li><li>Myriad Races republicanism written into constitution → racial privileges unconstitutional</li><li>Alaya supervision → single-point dependency eliminated</li><li>Four powers separated → rule of man becomes rule of law</li><li>20% Activation Strategy → strong ones emerge in numbers, SPDCI drops</li></ol><p>Benefits are not additive, but multiplicative: each institution amplifies the others; after a hundred years civilization energy is tens of times the original system.</p><p>A common misunderstanding needs clarification: injecting Anchor Symbiosis institutions does not require turning Tang Luo into a &quot;bad person,&quot; nor denying his historical contribution. On the contrary, Tang Luo achieving this much within the old framework proves his vision and ability — if he were born in Heng Yuan Zhou, he would be one of the Anchor Council&#39;s most respected legislators. The problem is not that Tang Luo is not good enough, but that the framework he was in did not allow him to &quot;be better.&quot; Institutional alternative&#39;s essence is liberating Tang Luo from &quot;ceiling&quot; to &quot;starting point&quot;: the academy, methods, order he established are all preserved as institutional assets, only changing from &quot;Tang Luo&#39;s private property&quot; to &quot;Myriad Races&#39; public property.&quot; This transformation is the greatest fulfillment of his life&#39;s work.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: take Tang-Luo world as base</li><li><strong>Variable injection</strong>: full set of Anchor Symbiosis institutions</li><li><strong>Time acceleration</strong>: Origin Acceleration Domain hundred years</li><li><strong>Review conclusion</strong>: output &quot;Institutional Alternative Benefit Report&quot; — after a hundred years civilization energy grows tens of times, SPDCI drops to 0.05, Tang Luo shifts from &quot;sage lord&quot; to &quot;one of the founding fathers&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: high</strong>. The alternative directly interfaces with foundational settings</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely low</strong>. Institutional alternative is structural upgrade, not depending on any single-point setting</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: after the alternative, drops from &quot;high&quot; to &quot;extremely low&quot;</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: utilization rises from 20% to 90%</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the predation structure is dismantled, the predator label automatically lifted</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s good will is amplified by institutions, not diluted</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad-Races participation rises from 5% to 95%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: within a hundred years cross-plane capability is achieved</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-long-term-tracking-of-institutional-alternative-benefits" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Long-Term Tracking of Institutional Alternative Benefits <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-long-term-tracking-of-institutional-alternative-benefits" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Long-Term Tracking of Institutional Alternative Benefits&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilization trajectory after injecting Anchor Symbiosis into the Tang-Luo world, its benefit data is not a one-time prediction, but Alaya Network&#39;s continuously tracked dynamic result. Heng Yuan Zhou records the change curves of energy utilization, Myriad-Races coverage, and institutional hardness in the hundred years after injection. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s institutional alternative benefits are incrementally increasing, because the law-first axiom ensures institutions self-reinforce once landed, not requiring continuous external push. The universal equal infinite law plays the role of &quot;right seed&quot; during injection, fundamentally changing Myriad Races&#39; expectations of institutions.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Institutional alternative is not denying Tang Luo, but fulfilling Tang Luo. Everything he wanted to give all beings, institutions can give, and give more stably, longer, broader. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s plan: invite Tang Luo down from &quot;sage lord,&quot; let him be an &quot;ordinary citizen&quot; — this is the greatest respect for him.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · quantifying institutional alternative benefits described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./74-三百套体系开放事件.html">74-300-System Opening Event</a> · <a href="./75-20%激活战略实施.html">75-20% Activation Strategy Implementation</a> · <a href="./77-万族共和成立.html">77-Myriad Races Republicanism Established</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
